     4990   empty temp-table thbjattr_thbj-attr.
     4991   run adm/shattri.p (
     4992      input "get":U
     4993     ,input ''
     4994     ,input 0
     4995     ,input 'nakl-glob':U
     4996     ,input  ""
     4997     ,output v-value-character
